.playwright-mcp/

# Playwright is a local verification tool only. This hub ships no dependencies
# and no build step, so a dependency manifest must never enter a commit --
# a subagent running `npm install playwright` in the repo root created these
# once already. node_modules/ is ignored above; these are the committable half.
package.json
package-lock.json
